# The secrets this app knows how to use. Names only: never put real values in this file.
#
# Where to add real values:
#   - For your public app:  GitHub repo > Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions
#   - For your preview:     GitHub repo > Settings > Secrets and variables > Codespaces
# Use the same name in both places.
#
# A new app needs no secrets. Add a line here (name only) for each one your app starts to use.
# The examples in examples/ list the secrets they need in examples/README.md.
